      "default": "<span style=\"color: rgb(246, 239, 239);\"><strong>Cyclical Harmony&nbsp;</strong><br><br>Ayurvedic philosophy recognizes that humans exist as part of nature's cycles. By aligning our daily practices with these natural rhythms, we create balance within ourselves and with the world around us, fostering optimal health.\n</span>"
